Package: gflow
Title: Gradient Flow Data Analysis Framework
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R:
    person(given = "Pawel",
           family = "Gajer",
           email = "pgajer@gmail.com",
           role = c("aut", "cre"))
Author: Pawel Gajer [aut, cre]
Maintainer: Pawel Gajer <pgajer@gmail.com>
Description: Constructs and explores basin and gradient-flow complexes on
    structured high-dimensional data. The package provides basin, cell,
    trajectory, and flow-aware analysis methods, including local association
    summaries defined by those geometric objects. Generic graph construction is
    supplied by 'dgraphs'. Retired response-smoothing and conditional
    expectation estimators are preserved separately in 'gflowx'.
